msgid ""
"In a contributor-verified text-only run using this three-node layout with "
"MXFP8, EAGLE3, fp8 KV cache and the optional `--language-model-only` flag, "
"all 232 requests succeeded at 128k input / 1k output and concurrency 58. "
"Average TPOT was 27.3 ms and aggregate output throughput was about 1840 "
"tokens/s. In that setup, enabling Decode FlashComm1 increased output "
"throughput from 1807.9 to 1840.7 tokens/s (about 1.8%). These measurements "
"describe that workload and configuration; the launch templates leave "
"`--language-model-only` optional."
msgstr ""
"在贡献者验证的纯文本运行中，使用此三节点布局并启用 MXFP8、EAGLE3、fp8 KV cache 以及可选的 `--language-model-"
"only` 标志，全部 232 个请求在 128k 输入 / 1k 输出、并发 58 的情况下均成功完成。平均 TPOT 为 27.3 "
"ms，总输出吞吐量约为 1840 tokens/s。在该设置中，启用 Decode FlashComm1 将输出吞吐量从 1807.9 提升至 "
