"保留为可选。"

msgid ""
"- `--language-model-only` (optional): For text-only tests, add this flag as needed based on the available KV cache capacity to avoid reserving memory for multimodal processing.\n"
"- `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\"` (optional, omitted by default): Limits the maximum decode batch size covered by ACL graph capture and the graph memory reserved for it; the program default is `512`. With EAGLE3 speculative decoding, each request is expanded to `1 + num_speculative_tokens` tokens in one decode step (`4` tokens when `num_speculative_tokens=3`). Since DP distributes requests per rank, the per-rank batch size matters: for example, with `DP2` and `--max-num-seqs 256`, each DP rank handles 128 requests, producing `4 × 128 = 512` tokens per step — exactly at the default limit. If concurrency rises to 257, one DP rank handles 129 requests, giving `4 × 129 = 516 > 512`; batches above 512 skip graph capture and fall back to eager execution, lowering decode throughput. In that case set `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024` in `--compilation-config` (e.g., `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\",\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}'`). Because a larger capture size reserves additional NPU memory, the configurations in this tutorial keep the default; add this option only when your target concurrency requires it.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs 256`: Decode concurrency used by the verified 950DT products 1P1D launch. A3 uses `128`."
msgstr ""
"- `--language-model-only`（可选）：对于纯文本测试，根据可用的 KV cache 容量按需添加此标志，以避免为多模态处理预留内存。\n"
"- `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\"`（可选，默认省略）：限制 ACL 图捕获所覆盖的最大解码批次大小以及为其预留的图内存；程序默认值为 `512`。使用 EAGLE3 投机解码时，每个请求在一个解码步骤中扩展为 `1 + num_speculative_tokens` 个 tokens（当 `num_speculative_tokens=3` 时为 `4` 个 tokens）。由于 DP 按 rank 分发请求，每个 rank 的批次大小很重要：例如，使用 `DP2` 和 `--max-num-seqs 256` 时，每个 DP rank 处理 128 个请求，每步产生 `4 × 128 = 512` 个 tokens——恰好处于默认限制。如果并发升至 257，一个 DP rank 处理 129 个请求，得到 `4 × 129 = 516 > 512`；超过 512 的批次会跳过图捕获并回退到 eager 执行，从而降低解码吞吐量。在这种情况下，在 `--compilation-config` 中设置 `\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024`（例如 `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\",\"max_cudagraph_capture_size\":1024}'`）。由于更大的捕获大小会预留额外的 NPU 内存，本教程中的配置保持默认值；仅当目标并发需要时才添加此选项。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs 256`：经验证的 Ascend 950DT系列产品 1P1D 启动所使用的 Decode 并发数。A3 使用 `128`。"

msgid ""
"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`: Uses Mooncake as the KV cache transfer connector between prefill and decode nodes.\n"
"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`: `kv_producer` on prefill nodes, `kv_consumer` on decode nodes.\n"
"- `\"kv_port\"`: Port for Mooncake KV transfer. Use different ports for prefill and decode. The verified values are A3 `36000`/`36100` and 950DT products `30000`/`26900`.\n"
"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`: Enables Ascend direct transfer for KV cache.\n"
"- `\"ascend_local_comm_res_path\": \"/etc/hixlep\"` (950DT products only): Used for RoCE-attached 950DT with `/etc/hixlep/` mounted. On SuperPod UB fabric, omit this option and export `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'` instead, as in the Section 5.3.1 templates. The Section 5.3.2 950DT KV-pool templates retain the static-path setup; adapt the Mooncake connector inside the `MultiConnector` the same way when using UB fabric.\n"
"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` sections: `dp_size`, `tp_size`, and `pp_size` must match the actual global layout on every node. A3 uses `prefill: dp1 tp4 pp4` on one node and `decode: dp8 tp4 pp1` across two nodes (four local DP ranks per Decode node). 950DT products uses `prefill: dp2 tp4 pp1` and `decode: dp2 tp4 pp1` for two nodes, or `decode: dp4 tp4 pp1` for three nodes."
msgstr ""
"- `\"kv_connector\": \"MooncakeConnectorV1\"`：使用 Mooncake 作为 prefill 和 decode 节点之间的 KV cache 传输连接器。\n"
"- `\"kv_role\": \"kv_producer\"` / `\"kv_consumer\"`：prefill 节点上为 `kv_producer`，decode 节点上为 `kv_consumer`。\n"
"- `\"kv_port\"`：Mooncake KV 传输端口。prefill 和 decode 使用不同的端口。经验证的值是 A3 为 `36000`/`36100`，Ascend 950DT系列产品为 `30000`/`26900`。\n"
"- `\"use_ascend_direct\": true`：为 KV cache 启用昇腾直接传输。\n"
"- `\"ascend_local_comm_res_path\": \"/etc/hixlep\"`（仅 Ascend 950DT系列产品）：用于挂载了 `/etc/hixlep/` 的 RoCE 连接的 950DT。在 SuperPod UB 网络上，省略此选项并改为导出 `ASCEND_LOCAL_COMM_RES='{\"version\":\"1.3\"}'`，如第 5.3.1 节模板所示。第 5.3.2 节的 950DT KV-pool 模板保留了静态路径设置；使用 UB 网络时，以相同方式调整 `MultiConnector` 内的 Mooncake 连接器。\n"
"- `\"prefill\"` / `\"decode\"` 部分：`dp_size`、`tp_size` 和 `pp_size` 必须与每个节点上的实际全局布局匹配。A3 在一个节点上使用 `prefill: dp1 tp4 pp4`，在两个节点上使用 `decode: dp8 tp4 pp1`（每个 Decode 节点有四个本地 DP rank）。Ascend 950DT系列产品在两个节点上使用 `prefill: dp2 tp4 pp1` 和 `decode: dp2 tp4 pp1`，或在三个节点上使用 `decode: dp4 tp4 pp1`。"

msgid ""
"- Wait until Prefill node and DP ranks prints `Application startup complete` before starting the proxy.\n"
"- The proxy maps every prefill engine endpoint and every decode engine endpoint to a single entry point on port `8009`.\n"
"- If requests reach the proxy but no output is returned, check that the proxy host list includes every healthy Prefill node and DP ranks, and that all nodes still have free NPU memory after the previous run."
msgstr ""
"- 在启动代理之前，等待 Prefill 节点和 DP rank 打印 `Application startup complete`。\n"
"- 代理将每个 prefill 引擎端点和每个 decode 引擎端点映射到端口 `8009` 上的单一入口点。\n"
"- 如果请求到达代理但没有返回输出，请检查代理主机列表是否包含每个健康的 Prefill 节点和 DP rank，以及所有节点在之前的运行后是否仍有空闲的 NPU 内存。"

msgid "#### 5.3.2 Prefill-Decode Disaggregation with KV Cache Pool"
msgstr "#### 5.3.2 使用 KV Cache Pool 的 Prefill-Decode 分离"

msgid ""
"This section builds on [Section 5.3.1](#531-prefill-decode-disaggregation). "
"The A3 example uses the same three-node 1P1D topology, "
"`launch_online_dp.py`, proxy mapping, and MiniMax `vllm serve` settings as "
"Section 5.3.1 (one P plus two D nodes). The 950DT pool example retains its "
"two-node 1P1D topology. Prefill and Decode switch to `MultiConnector` so "
"live P→D KV transfer and Mooncake KV Cache Pool work together:"
msgstr ""
"本节建立在[第 5.3.1 节](#531-prefill-decode-disaggregation)的基础上。A3 示例使用与第 5.3.1 "
"节相同的三节点 1P1D 拓扑、`launch_online_dp.py`、代理映射和 MiniMax `vllm serve` 设置（一个 P "
"节点加两个 D 节点）。950DT pool 示例保留其两节点 1P1D 拓扑。Prefill 和 Decode 切换到 "
"`MultiConnector`，以便实时 P→D KV 传输和 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 协同工作："

msgid ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` transfers KV from Prefill to Decode in real time (same role as Section 5.3.1).\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` stores KV in the Mooncake KV Cache Pool so later Prefills with the same prefix can hit the pool instead of recomputing.\n"
"- By default the Prefill node performs pool lookup, load, and write."
msgstr ""
"- `MooncakeConnectorV1` 将 KV 从 Prefill 实时传输到 Decode（与 5.3.1 节中的作用相同）。\n"
"- `AscendStoreConnector` 将 KV 存储到 Mooncake KV Cache Pool 中，使后续具有相同前缀的 Prefill 可以命中该池而无需重新计算。\n"
"- 默认情况下，Prefill 节点执行池查找、加载和写入。"

msgid ""
"The examples below enable three-tier KV storage: the active NPU KV cache, "
"the Mooncake memory pool, and SSD offload."
msgstr "以下示例启用三层 KV 存储：活跃的 NPU KV 缓存、Mooncake 内存池以及 SSD 卸载。"

msgid ""
"**Compared with normal PD in Section 5.3.1, pay attention to these pooling-"
"only requirements:**"
msgstr "**与 5.3.1 节中的普通 PD 相比，请特别注意以下仅池化模式才有的要求：**"

msgid "| Item | Normal PD (5.3.1) | Pooled PD (this section) |"
msgstr "| 项目 | 普通 PD（5.3.1） | 池化 PD（本节） |"

msgid ""
"| Mooncake Master | Not required | Start `mooncake_master "
"--enable_offload=true` before Decode / Prefill |"
msgstr ""
"| Mooncake Master | 不需要 | 在启动 Decode / Prefill 之前启动 `mooncake_master "
"--enable_offload=true` |"

msgid ""
"| `mooncake.json` | Not required | Required on every rank; A3 P and both D "
"nodes use `15GB`; 950DT P and D use `64GB`; enable SSD offload on all nodes "
"|"
msgstr ""
"| `mooncake.json` | 不需要 | 每个 rank 都需要；A3 的 P 和两个 D 节点使用 `15GB`；950DT 的 P 和 D"
" 使用 `64GB`；在所有节点上启用 SSD 卸载 |"

msgid ""
"| Extra env | Section 5.3.1 `HCCL_*` only | Keep 5.3.1 env, then add pool "
"fabric/UB exports from [KV Cache Pool Deployment "
"Guide](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) |"
msgstr ""
"| 额外环境变量 | 仅 5.3.1 节的 `HCCL_*` | 保留 5.3.1 节的环境变量，然后从 [KV Cache Pool "
"部署指南](../../user_guide/feature_guide/kv_cache_pool_ascend_store.md) 中添加池化 "
"fabric/UB 相关导出 |"

msgid ""
"| Container mounts | 950DT needs `/etc/hixlep/` | Also mount "
"`/etc/hccn.conf` and the local SSD offload directory; keep `/etc/hixlep/` on"
" 950DT |"
msgstr ""
"| 容器挂载 | 950DT 需要 `/etc/hixlep/` | 还需挂载 `/etc/hccn.conf` 和本地 SSD 卸载目录；在 "
"950DT 上保留 `/etc/hixlep/` |"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.1 前提条件"

msgid ""
"On 950DT products, also keep the `/etc/hixlep/` mount from Section 5.3.1 for"
" Ascend direct KV transfer."
msgstr "在 Ascend 950DT系列产品上，还需保留 5.3.1 节中的 `/etc/hixlep/` 挂载，用于昇腾直接 KV 传输。"

msgid ""
"Place `mooncake.json` next to `run_dp_template.sh` on every node. Use the "
"same reachable Mooncake Master address and `tenant_id` across P and D. "
"`global_segment_size` is allocated per worker rank, not per node; a non-zero"
" value must be aligned to `1GB`. If `MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE` is "
"already exported, update it to the intended size or unset it before startup "
"because it overrides the JSON value."
msgstr ""
"在每个节点上将 `mooncake.json` 放在 `run_dp_template.sh` 旁边。在 P 和 D 上使用相同的可达 Mooncake"
" Master 地址和 `tenant_id`。`global_segment_size` 按 worker rank "
"分配，而不是按节点分配；非零值必须按 `1GB` 对齐。如果已导出 "
"`MOONCAKE_GLOBAL_SEGMENT_SIZE`，请将其更新为预期大小，或在启动前取消设置，因为它会覆盖 JSON 中的值。"

msgid ""
"A3 `mooncake.json` on P, first D and second D (replace "
"`<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` with the actual Master IP):"
msgstr ""
"A3 上 P、第一个 D 和第二个 D 的 `mooncake.json`（将 `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>` 替换为实际的 Master"
" IP）："

msgid ""
"The A3 example uses `15GB` per worker rank on P and both D nodes. Adjust "
"this value to each machine's available allocatable memory and fragmentation "
"after reserving memory for vLLM and other processes. Allow additional space "
"for the SSD I/O buffer and allocation headroom, and account for all "
"contributing worker ranks on the node."
msgstr ""
"A3 示例在 P 和两个 D 节点上为每个 worker rank 使用 `15GB`。在为 vLLM "
"和其他进程预留内存后，请根据每台机器的可用可分配内存和碎片情况调整此值。为 SSD I/O 缓冲区和分配余量预留额外空间，并考虑节点上所有参与贡献的 "
"worker rank。"

msgid "950DT Prefill `mooncake.json` (replace `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>`):"
msgstr "950DT Prefill 的 `mooncake.json`（替换 `<MOONCAKE_MASTER_IP>`）："

msgid ""
"950DT Decode `mooncake.json` (same Master and `tenant_id`; both P and D "
"contribute memory and enable SSD offload):"
msgstr ""
"950DT Decode 的 `mooncake.json`（相同的 Master 和 `tenant_id`；P 和 D 均贡献内存并启用 SSD "
"卸载）："

msgid ""
"The 950DT examples use `64GB` per worker rank on both P and D. Adjust the "
"size to the actual available memory and fragmentation on each machine rather"
" than treating `64GB` as a fixed requirement. Budget for all worker ranks on"
" the node, SSD I/O buffers, and other allocations; reduce the segment size "
"if the machine cannot register the requested memory."
msgstr ""
"950DT 示例在 P 和 D 上为每个 worker rank 使用 `64GB`。请根据每台机器的实际可用内存和碎片情况调整大小，而不要将 "
"`64GB` 视为固定要求。为节点上的所有 worker rank、SSD I/O 缓冲区和其他分配预留预算；如果机器无法注册所请求的内存，请减小 "
"segment 大小。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.2 Environment Variables"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.2 环境变量"

msgid "Common pooling exports on Prefill node and DP ranks:"
msgstr "Prefill 节点和 DP rank 上常用的池化导出："

msgid ""
"| 800I/T A3 (HCCS, recommended) | HDK >= 26.0, or HDK >= 25.5 with mooncake "
">= v0.3.11; CANN >= 9.0.0 | `export ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` | Keep "
"the Section 5.3.1 `HCCL_IF_IP` / socket IFNAME exports. |"
msgstr ""
"| 800I/T A3（HCCS，推荐） | HDK >= 26.0，或 HDK >= 25.5 且 mooncake >= v0.3.11；CANN "
">= 9.0.0 | `export ASCEND_ENABLE_USE_FABRIC_MEM=1` | 保留 5.3.1 节的 "
"`HCCL_IF_IP` / socket IFNAME 导出。 |"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.3 Prefill / Decode Scripts"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.3 Prefill / Decode 脚本"

msgid ""
"Prefill-Decode disaggregation with KV Cache Pool on 3 Atlas 800I A3 (64GB × "
"16) for `MiniMax-M3-w8a8` (W8A8) with `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA`."
msgstr ""
"在 3 台 Atlas 800I A3（64GB × 16）上，使用 KV Cache Pool 为 `MiniMax-M3-w8a8`（W8A8）配合"
" `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` 进行 Prefill-Decode 分离部署。"

msgid ""
"One Prefill node uses `DP1 × TP4 × PP4`; two Decode nodes form a global `DP8"
" × TP4 × PP1` group, with four local ranks per node. Copy the same Decode "
"template to both D nodes and use the node-specific launch blocks below. "
"Service settings match Section 5.3.1; `MultiConnector` adds the KV pool. The"
" `--language-model-only` option remains in the existing optional guidance "
"rather than the launch commands."
msgstr ""
"一个 Prefill 节点使用 `DP1 × TP4 × PP4`；两个 Decode 节点组成全局 `DP8 × TP4 × PP1` "
"组，每个节点有四个本地 rank。将相同的 Decode 模板复制到两个 D 节点，并使用下方针对各节点的启动配置块。服务设置与第 5.3.1 "
"节一致；`MultiConnector` 增加了 KV 池。`--language-model-only` "
"选项仍保留在现有的可选指导中，而不在启动命令中。"

msgid ""
"Start order on A3: Mooncake Master → both Decode nodes → Prefill → Proxy. "
"Use the three-node commands in Section 5.3.2.4, with the same DP/TP/PP sizes"
" and API ports as Section 5.3.1 A3. The single P API and all eight D APIs "
"must be healthy before starting the proxy."
msgstr ""
"A3 上的启动顺序：Mooncake Master → 两个 Decode 节点 → Prefill → Proxy。使用第 5.3.2.4 "
"节中的三节点命令，DP/TP/PP 大小和 API 端口与第 5.3.1 节 A3 一致。在启动 proxy 之前，单个 P API 和全部八个 D "
"API 必须处于健康状态。"

msgid ""
"Prefill-Decode disaggregation with KV Cache Pool on 2 950DT products (96GB ×"
" 8) for `MiniMax-M3-MXFP8` with `MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA`. Mount "
"`/etc/hixlep/`, `/etc/hccn.conf`, and the local SSD directory from Section "
"5.3.2.1. Place the Prefill / Decode `mooncake.json` from Section 5.3.2.1 "
"next to `run_dp_template.sh` (`global_segment_size` is `64GB` on both roles,"
" with SSD offload enabled). Set `master_server_address` to the same "
"reachable Mooncake Master on both nodes."
msgstr ""
"在 2 台 Ascend 950DT系列产品（96GB × 8）上为 `MiniMax-M3-MXFP8` 搭配 "
"`MiniMax-M3-EAGLE3-GQA` 使用 KV Cache Pool 进行 Prefill-Decode 分离部署。挂载 "
"`/etc/hixlep/`、`/etc/hccn.conf` 以及第 5.3.2.1 节中的本地 SSD 目录。将第 5.3.2.1 节中的 "
"Prefill / Decode `mooncake.json` 放到 `run_dp_template.sh` 旁边（两个角色的 "
"`global_segment_size` 均为 `64GB`，并启用 SSD 卸载）。在两个节点上将 `master_server_address` "
"设置为同一个可访问的 Mooncake Master。"

msgid ""
"Start order on 950DT: Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → Proxy. Use the "
"Section 5.3.1 950DT two-node commands (`DP2` on both roles, proxy on "
"`8009`), with the pooled templates above; do not use the three-node scaling "
"commands for this two-node example."
msgstr ""
"950DT 上的启动顺序：Mooncake Master → Decode → Prefill → Proxy。使用第 5.3.1 节 950DT "
"双节点命令（两个角色均为 `DP2`，proxy 监听 `8009`），并配合上述池化模板；此双节点示例不要使用三节点扩展命令。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.4 Start the Services"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.4 启动服务"

msgid "Start in this order:"
msgstr "按以下顺序启动："

msgid ""
"1. Start `mooncake_master` on the Prefill node or another reachable host, "
"and use its actual IP in every `mooncake.json`. Confirm port `50088` is "
"reachable from all model nodes:"
msgstr ""
"1. 在 Prefill 节点或其他可访问的主机上启动 `mooncake_master`，并在每个 `mooncake.json` 中使用其实际 "
"IP。确认所有模型节点都能访问端口 `50088`："

msgid ""
"2. Start the first A3 Decode node (global DP ranks 0–3). Use the pooled "
"Decode template, not the normal-PD template:"
msgstr "2. 启动第一个 A3 Decode 节点（全局 DP rank 0–3）。使用池化 Decode 模板，而不是普通 PD 模板："

msgid ""
"Wait for rank 0 to print `Started DP Coordinator process`. Keep this shell "
"running while starting the second node from another shell; initialization "
"needs both D nodes. On 950DT, use the Section 5.3.1 two-node Decode launch "
"command with the 950DT pooled template, then skip step 3."
msgstr ""
"等待 rank 0 打印 `Started DP Coordinator process`。保持此 shell 运行，同时从另一个 shell "
"启动第二个节点；初始化需要两个 D 节点。在 950DT 上，使用第 5.3.1 节的双节点 Decode 启动命令并配合 950DT "
"池化模板，然后跳过步骤 3。"

msgid ""
"3. Start the second A3 Decode node (global DP ranks 4–7). `LOCAL_IP` is the "
"second node's IP, but `DP_ADDRESS` remains the first Decode node's IP:"
msgstr ""
"3. 启动第二个 A3 Decode 节点（全局 DP rank 4–7）。`LOCAL_IP` 是第二个节点的 IP，但 `DP_ADDRESS` "
"仍为第一个 Decode 节点的 IP："

msgid ""
"Both Decode nodes expose API ports `31260`–`31263`. Wait for all eight DP "
"ranks to print `Application startup complete`."
msgstr ""
"两个 Decode 节点均暴露 API 端口 `31260`–`31263`。等待全部八个 DP rank 打印 `Application "
"startup complete`。"

msgid "4. Start Prefill. On A3, use the pooled P template:"
msgstr "4. 启动 Prefill。在 A3 上，使用池化 P 模板："

msgid ""
"On 950DT, use the Section 5.3.1 two-node Prefill command with its pooled "
"template. Wait for every Prefill rank to print `Application startup "
"complete`."
msgstr ""
"在 950DT 上，使用第 5.3.1 节的双节点 Prefill 命令并配合其池化模板。等待每个 Prefill rank 打印 "
"`Application startup complete`。"

msgid ""
"5. Start the proxy. The A3 proxy registers one Prefill endpoint and eight "
"Decode endpoints:"
msgstr "5. 启动 proxy。A3 proxy 注册一个 Prefill 端点和八个 Decode 端点："

msgid ""
"On 950DT, use the Section 5.3.1 two-node proxy command (two P and two D "
"endpoints). The service is accessible at `<proxy_ip>:8009`; use this "
"endpoint in Section 7."
msgstr ""
"在 950DT 上，使用第 5.3.1 节的双节点 proxy 命令（两个 P 和两个 D 端点）。服务可通过 `<proxy_ip>:8009` "
"访问；在第 7 节中使用此端点。"

msgid "##### 5.3.2.5 Verification"
msgstr "##### 5.3.2.5 验证"

msgid ""
"1. Confirm Mooncake Master port `50088` is reachable, Master runs with `--enable_offload=true`, and every node uses the same Master address and `tenant_id`. For A3, confirm P and both D nodes load `global_segment_size=\"15GB\"`; for 950DT, confirm P and D both load `\"64GB\"`. Check worker logs for successful segment registration.\n"
"2. Confirm every Decode engine port is ready, then every Prefill engine port. A3 has nine APIs (one P plus eight D); 950DT has four (two P plus two D).\n"
"3. Send requests only to the proxy on port `8009`.\n"
"4. Warm up with a repeated-prefix request, then send again and check Prefill logs for KV Pool lookup/get/put and hit information.\n"
"5. Confirm Decode logs still show a normal Mooncake P→D KV transfer.\n"
"6. Confirm SSD storage initializes under `ssd_offload_path` for each contributing worker. Use a working set larger than the memory pool to verify SSD offload and subsequent reads; a memory-pool hit alone does not exercise the SSD tier."
msgstr ""
"1. 确认 Mooncake Master 端口 `50088` 可访问，Master 以 `--enable_offload=true` 运行，且每个节点使用相同的 Master 地址和 `tenant_id`。对于 A3，确认 P 和两个 D 节点均加载 `global_segment_size=\"15GB\"`；对于 950DT，确认 P 和 D 均加载 `\"64GB\"`。检查 worker 日志以确认 segment 注册成功。\n"
"2. 确认每个 Decode 引擎端口就绪，然后确认每个 Prefill 引擎端口就绪。A3 有九个 API（一个 P 加八个 D）；950DT 有四个（两个 P 加两个 D）。\n"
"3. 仅向端口 `8009` 上的 proxy 发送请求。\n"
"4. 使用重复前缀请求进行预热，然后再次发送，并检查 Prefill 日志中的 KV Pool 查找/get/put 及命中信息。\n"
"5. 确认 Decode 日志仍显示正常的 Mooncake P→D KV 传输。\n"
"6. 确认每个参与 worker 的 SSD 存储在 `ssd_offload_path` 下完成初始化。使用大于内存池的工作集来验证 SSD 卸载及后续读取；仅命中内存池并不能测试 SSD 层级。"

msgid "### 5.4 1M-Token Context Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.4 1M Token 上下文部署"

msgid ""
"| Platform / weights | NPUs per node | TP / PP / DP | `max-model-len` | "
"`max-num-batched-tokens` | KV cache dtype |"
msgstr ""
"| 平台 / 权重 | 每节点 NPU 数 | TP / PP / DP | `max-model-len` | `max-num-batched-"
"tokens` | KV cache dtype |"

msgid ""
"All three configurations use Model Runner V2, `max-num-seqs=1`, "
"`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph mode, and chunked prefill. Prefix caching, "
"asynchronous scheduling, and static kernels are disabled; no speculative "
"model is loaded. The smaller batched-token budget controls the size of each "
"prefill chunk rather than the total context length."
msgstr ""
"所有三种配置均使用 Model Runner V2、`max-num-seqs=1`、`FULL_DECODE_ONLY` graph 模式以及分块 "
"prefill。前缀缓存、异步调度和静态 kernel 均已禁用；不加载投机模型。较小的 batched-token 预算控制的是每个 prefill "
"分块的大小，而不是总上下文长度。"

msgid ""
"Prepare the container and weights as described in Sections 3 and 4. Replace "
"`<MODEL_PATH>` (A3) or `<WEIGHT_PATH>` (950DT) with the local weight "
"directory. Replace `<NIC_NAME>` in both `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` and "
"`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME` with the same local communication interface. The "
"commands use the CANN environment-script paths from the deployment "
"configurations; adjust these paths to the installed CANN directory. The "
"950DT examples also require the matching `experimental_950_transformer` "
"vendor package before sourcing its environment script."
msgstr ""
"按照第 3 节和第 4 节所述准备容器和权重。将 `<MODEL_PATH>`（A3）或 "
"`<WEIGHT_PATH>`（950DT）替换为本地权重目录。将 `HCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME` 和 "
"`GLOO_SOCKET_IFNAME` 中的 `<NIC_NAME>` 替换为同一个本地通信接口。命令使用部署配置中的 CANN "
"环境脚本路径；请将这些路径调整为已安装的 CANN 目录。950DT 示例还需要匹配的 `experimental_950_transformer` "
"厂商包，然后才能 source 其环境脚本。"

msgid "=== \"Atlas 800I A3 (W8A8)\""
msgstr "=== \"Atlas 800I A3 (W8A8)\""

msgid ""
"Use one 16-NPU node with TP4/PP4/DP1. This long-context configuration splits"
" the 60 transformer layers evenly as `15,15,15,15`. The `1049600` context "
"limit leaves room for 1,048,576 input tokens and up to 1024 generated "
"tokens. `VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN=1` permits the configured limit when "
"it exceeds the checkpoint's declared maximum."
msgstr ""
"使用一台 16-NPU 节点，配置为 TP4/PP4/DP1。此长上下文配置将 60 个 transformer 层均匀划分为 "
"`15,15,15,15`。`1049600` 的上下文限制为 1,048,576 个输入 Token 和最多 1024 个生成 Token "
"留出空间。当配置的限制超过 checkpoint 声明的最大值时，`VLLM_ALLOW_LONG_MAX_MODEL_LEN=1` 允许使用该限制。"

msgid ""
"`--long-prefill-token-threshold 8192` sets the long-prefill threshold used "
"with chunked prefill. The scheduler uses this threshold to limit the prefill"
" tokens scheduled for a long request in one iteration, while `--max-num-"
"batched-tokens 8192` bounds the total token budget for the iteration. In "
"this single-request example both values are 8192, so the 1M prompt is "
"processed in chunks within that budget. This parameter does not reduce the "
"total context limit configured by `--max-model-len`. See the [vLLM scheduler"
" "
"arguments](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/configuration/engine_args/#--long-"
"prefill-token-threshold) for details."
msgstr ""
"`--long-prefill-token-threshold 8192` "
"设置与分块预填充配合使用的长预填充阈值。调度器使用该阈值限制单次迭代中为长请求调度的预填充 token 数量，而 `--max-num-batched-"
"tokens 8192` 则限定该次迭代的总 token 预算。在这个单请求示例中，两个值均为 8192，因此 1M "
"的提示词会在该预算内分块处理。该参数不会降低由 `--max-model-len` 配置的总上下文限制。详情请参阅 [vLLM "
"调度器参数](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/configuration/engine_args/#--long-"
"prefill-token-threshold)。"

msgid "=== \"950DT Products (MXFP8)\""
msgstr "=== \"Ascend 950DT系列产品 (MXFP8)\""

msgid ""
"Choose either of the following single-node layouts on eight NPUs. Both use "
"FP8 KV cache while keeping layers 0, 1, and 2 in the default KV dtype. The "
"total input and generated tokens must fit within 1,048,576 tokens; for "
"example, reserve 1024 output tokens by limiting the input to at most "
"1,047,552 tokens."
msgstr ""
"在八个 NPU 上选择以下任意一种单节点部署方案。两者均使用 FP8 KV 缓存，同时将第 0、1、2 层保持为默认的 KV 数据类型。输入与生成的 "
"token 总数必须控制在 1,048,576 个 token 以内；例如，通过将输入限制为最多 1,047,552 个 token 来预留 1024 "
"个输出 token。"

